\newlabel{fig:degree}{{6}{6}{Degree distribution $P(k)$ of the FoF network on semi-logarithmic (left) and double-logarithmic (right) axes. The dashed curve is the Poisson law of an Erd\H {o}s--R\'enyi graph of the same mean degree. The data exceed the null at both ends (a $34.9\%$ isolated fraction and a heavy tail to $k_{\max } = 43$) and the tail is concave and truncated, not a pure power law}{figure.caption.10}{}}
\newlabel{fig:degree@cref}{{[figure][6][]6}{[1][5][]6}{}{}{}}
